# What never belongs in the build context. Everything the image needs is source,
# the lockfile and `packages/db/drizzle`; the build stage produces the rest.

# Installed and built on the host, for the host.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
*.tsbuildinfo

# Tooling output.
coverage
**/coverage
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.log
test-results
**/test-results
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
blob-report
**/blob-report
.playwright

# Secrets. `.env.example` is a template and still not needed in the image.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# History and CI, which the image never reads.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
.agents

# Documentation: the image serves the admin SPA, not the docs.
docs
*.md

# Browser tests and their baselines.
**/e2e
